classDiagram
direction LR

namespace `Task 4 — Диаграмма классов Java-реализации — com_example_batchprocessing` {
  class BatchProcessingApplication {
    +main(args String[]) void$
  }

  class BatchConfiguration {
    <<configuration>>
    +reader(inputResource Resource) FlatFileItemReader~Product~
    +processor(jdbcTemplate JdbcTemplate) ProductItemProcessor
    +writer(dataSource DataSource) JdbcBatchItemWriter~Product~
    +importProductJob(...) Job
    +importProductsStep(...) Step
  }

  class Product {
    <<record>>
    -Long productId
    -Long productSku
    -String productName
    -Long productAmount
    -String productData
  }

  class ProductItemProcessor {
    -JdbcTemplate jdbcTemplate
    -Map~Long, String~ loyaltyBySku
    +process(product Product) Product
    -loadLoyaltyData() Map~Long, String~
  }

  class JobCompletionNotificationListener {
    -JdbcTemplate jdbcTemplate
    +afterJob(jobExecution JobExecution) void
  }
}

BatchProcessingApplication ..> BatchConfiguration : запускает Spring context
BatchConfiguration ..> ProductItemProcessor : создаёт processor
BatchConfiguration ..> Product : настраивает reader и writer
BatchConfiguration ..> JobCompletionNotificationListener : подключает к Job
ProductItemProcessor ..> Product : обогащает
